    solution: "def solve_upper(U, b):\n    size = len(U)\n    for i in range(size):\n        if U[i][i] == 0:\n            return None\n    x = [0.0] * size\n    for i in range(size - 1, -1, -1):\n        total = b[i]\n        for j in range(i + 1, size):\n            total -= U[i][j] * x[j]\n        x[i] = total / U[i][i]\n    return x",
    language: "python",
