    solution: "import math\n\ndef stable_softmax(logits):\n    if not logits:\n        return []\n    shift = max(logits)\n    exponentials = [math.exp(value - shift) for value in logits]\n    total = sum(exponentials)\n    return [value / total for value in exponentials]",
